{"id":"867fa39cfa0d7a32","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-min-function.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Minimum","display":"df-min-function — Primitive Recursive Minimum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-min-function","aliases":["88-df-min-function"],"display":"df-min-function — Primitive Recursive Minimum","depends_on":["[[88-df-subtraction-function]]","[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-min-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-min-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-min-function — Primitive Recursive Minimum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84fe0214dffac7e4\" href=\"?note=84fe0214dffac7e4\" title=\"88-df-subtraction-function\">88-df-subtraction-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景为集合论元语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,j,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y,z,j,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1}\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1}\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84fe0214dffac7e4\" href=\"?note=84fe0214dffac7e4\" title=\"88-df-subtraction-function\">88-df-subtraction-function</a> 的二元截断减法，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\min_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是下式引入的二元全函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是集合取最小值的部分函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min(x,y)\">\\(\\min(x,y)\\)</span>、多参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> 和集合写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min A\">\\(\\min A\\)</span> 的接口在下式给出。点值只在各自定义域内使用；这些记号不向对象算术语言增加原始符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\qquad\n\\min(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\qquad\n\\min(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(\\min_{\\mathbb N}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(\\min_{\\mathbb N}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min(x,y)=z\\longleftrightarrow\n(x\\le y\\land z=x)\\lor(y&lt;x\\land z=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min(x,y)=z\\longleftrightarrow\n(x\\le y\\land z=x)\\lor(y&lt;x\\land z=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{(A,n)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nn\\in A\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j&lt;n\\longrightarrow j\\notin A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{(A,n)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nn\\in A\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j&lt;n\\longrightarrow j\\notin A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})),\\qquad\n\\min\\{x,y\\}=\\min(x,y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})),\\qquad\n\\min\\{x,y\\}=\\min(x,y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1})\\coloneqq\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k),x_{k+1}),\\qquad\n\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k)=\\min\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1})\\coloneqq\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k),x_{k+1}),\\qquad\n\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k)=\\min\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地补充定义。截断减法是原始递归全函数，两次复合给出二元 min 的原始递归性。按 x≤y 与 y&lt;x 分情形应用截断减法性质，得到所列取值刻画；固定参数个数的多参数 min 由有限次复合得到。自然数良序性保证每个非空 A 有唯一最小元，故集合图恰在所列定义域有值；空集不取默认值。</p>\n<p>二元公式核对依据：<a href=\"https://www.andrew.cmu.edu/user/kk3n/recursionclass/chap2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CMU《Primitive Recursion》§2.6.12</a>，印刷第 14 页／PDF 第 7 页。集合图与多参数记号是本地接口补充，不据此声称核验本书原文。对任意 A 的集合取值并不构成 A 的可判定性或统一可计算性结论；无界 μ 搜索仍使用本书已有最小化原子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-subtraction-function","status":"resolved","id":"84fe0214dffac7e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-subtraction-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-subtraction-function","status":"resolved","id":"84fe0214dffac7e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[88-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2$ 取 [[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[88-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2$ 取 [[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y,z,j,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1}\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\min_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\min(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\min","display":false},{"tex":"\\min A","display":false},{"tex":"\\min_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\qquad\n\\min(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min_{\\mathbb N}(x,y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_2(\\min_{\\mathbb N}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min(x,y)=z\\longleftrightarrow\n(x\\le y\\land z=x)\\lor(y<x\\land z=y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{(A,n)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nn\\in A\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j<n\\longrightarrow j\\notin A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\min A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Min}_{\\mathbb N})),\\qquad\n\\min\\{x,y\\}=\\min(x,y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1})\\coloneqq\n\\min_{\\mathbb N}(\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k),x_{k+1}),\\qquad\n\\min(x_0,\\ldots,x_k)=\\min\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2686,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-df-min-function]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-substructure.md]]\n[[88-df-encoding.md]]\n[[88-df-finite-extension.md]]\n[[88-df-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-df-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-function.md]]\n[[88-df-function-recursive.md]]\n[[88-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[88-df-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-df-halting-set.md]]\n[[88-df-hyperarithmetical.md]]\n[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def.md]]\n[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-incompleteness-theorems.md]]\n[[88-df-index-set.md]]\n[[88-df-inductive-d